    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeholama, muana wa Ahaba, wakabanga kukokesha Bena Isalele mu Samalea mu tshidimu tshia dikumi ne muanda mukulu tshia bukelenge bua Yehoshafata, mukelenge wa Yuda; yeye wakakokesha bidimu dikumi ne bibidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakenza malu mabi ku mesu kua Yehowa; kadi kakenza bu muakenza tatu wandi ne mamu wandi; bualu bua yeye wakumusha luhingu lua Bâla luakenza tatu wandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi wakalamata malu mabi a Yalobama, muana wa Nebata, akenzesheye Bena Isalele, yeye kakâlekela nansha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mesha, mukelenge wa Moaba, wakadi muena mikoko; yeye wakadi ufila miosa ya binunu lukama bia bana ba mikoko ne ya binunu lukama bia bimpanga kudi mukelenge wa Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi hakafua Ahaba, mukelenge wa Moaba wakatombokela mukelenge wa Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku tshikondo atshi mukelenge Yeholama wakafuma ku Samalea, wakabikila Bena Isalele bonso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatuma mukenji kudi Yehoshafata, mukelenge wa Yuda, wamba ne, Mukelenge wa Moaba wakuntombokela, wewe neuye nʼanyi bua kuluangana ne Bena Moaba, anyi? Wakamukudimuna ne, Tuyaya nʼebe! Meme ndi bu wewe, bantu banyi badi bu bantu bebe, tubalu tuanyi tudi bu tubalu tuebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakamuebesha ne, Netuyile nshila kai? Wakamukudimuna ne, Mu nshila wa mu tshihela tshia Edome.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wa Isalele wakaya ne mukelenge wa Yuda ne mukelenge wa Edome; bakenda luendu lunyunguluke tô lua matuku muanda mutekete; kabakamona mai a kunuisha hau bantu anyi nyama biakadi bienda nʼabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wa Isalele wakamba ne, Aka, Yehowa wakabikila bakelenge aba basatu basangisha bua kubafila mu bianza bia Bena Moaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi Yehoshafata wakebesha ne, Kakuena muprofete wa Yehowa kunoko utudi mua kuebesha Yehowa dî mukana muandi, anyi? Umue wa bantu ba mukelenge wa Isalele wakamba ne, Elisha, muana wa Shafata, udiku, wakadi wela mai ha bianza bia Eliya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoshafata wakamba ne, Dî dia Yehowa didi mukana muandi. Nunku mukelenge wa Isalele ne Yehoshafata ne mukelenge wa Edome bakaya kudiye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wakebesha mukelenge wa Isalele ne, Ndi nʼebe bualu kai? Ya biebe kudi baprofete ba tatuʼebe ne ba mamuʼebe. Mukelenge wa Isalele wakamukudimuna ne, Nansha, bualu bua Yehowa wakabikila bakelenge aba basatu hohamue bua kubafila mu bianza bia Bena Moaba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elisha wakamba ne, Bu mudi Yehowa wa misumba ne muoyo, undi ngimana ku mpala kuandi, bu Yehoshafata, mukelenge wa Yuda, kayi muikaleku, tshiakadi kutangila luseke lûdi, tshiakadi kukumona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi katataka ulue ne muimbi wa tshisanji kundi. Hakamuimbila muimbi wa tshisanji, tshianza tshia Yehowa tshiakalua kudiye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Yehowa udi Wamba ne, Umbulai mitubu mu tshibanda etshi tshionso. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua Yehowa udi wamba ne, Kanuena nutangila luhehele, kanuena nutangila nvula, kadi tshibanda atshi netshiule tente ne mai, ne nuenu ne bimuna bienu ne tubalu tuenu nenunueku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi bualu ebu budi anu bualu bukese ku mesu kua Yehowa; yeye neafile Bena Moaba mu bianza bienu kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuenu nenuhaule misoko yonso idi ne ngumbu, ne misoko yonso idi miakane, nenushimbule mitshi yonso idi mimpe, nenujibike mishimi yonso ya mai, nenunyange madimi onso adi mimpe ne mabue kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshiabu bu ha diba didibo bafila milambu, mai akafuma ku nshila wa ku Edome, akûsha buloba abu tente.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Bena Moaba bonso lumu ne, Bakelenge aba bakalua kuluangana nʼetu, bonso bakadi ne bukole bakaluata bintu bia nvita, bakimana ku mukalu wa buloba buabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakabikabo ne dinda dionso, hakakenka diba ha mai, Bena Moaba bakatangila mai mikale makunze-kunzû bu mashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakambilangana ne, Au mmashi, bakelenge bakabutulangana bulelela, bakashihangana; nunku tuyai bietu, Bena Moaba, kuhaula bintu! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakafikabo ku tshitudilu tshia Bena Isalele, Bena Isalele bakajuka, bakataha Bena Moaba, bakanyema ku mpala kuabo, bakabuela mu buloba bua Bena Moaba, bakabashiha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakahaula misoko yabo; bakela mabue, muntu diandi muntu diandi, ha madimi mimpe, bakadisha tente; bakajibika mishimi ya mai; bakashimbula mitshi mimpe yonso, tô ne hakafikabo ku Kila-halaseta, bakashiyamu mabue nkayau. Kadi bakadi bela mabue ne bieledi, bakanyunguluka, bakaunyenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatangila mukelenge wa Moaba ne, Bakatuhita bukole, yeye wakasangisha bena nvita ba miele nkama muanda mutekete, wakakeba kuhitshila nʼabo tô ne kudi mukelenge wa Edome; kadi bakahanga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2KI 3:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe yeye wakangata muanʼa bute wandi wakadi mua kukokesha mu muaba wandi, wakamufila bu mulambu wa kuosha ha kahia ha mutu ha lumbu. Bakadi ne Bena Isalele tshiji tshikole, bakumuka kudiye, bakahingana ku buloba buabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2KI.3.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2KI.3.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
